 " \[LongDash] including the sign a product returns when its factors need \
reordering \[LongDash] matches neither definition and is returned \
unevaluated. Divide the coefficient out and multiply it back afterwards."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"57ee0202-01f1-462d-9cb5-3b8cd06123ca"],

